{"t":"Krailos Mines","s":"krailos-mines-29132","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/An_Imprisoned_Goblin_79f6c9.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <b>Krailos Mines</b> are mines located below the island of <a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos\">Krailos</a>. The entrance can be found in the southwest of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos%20Steppe\">Krailos Steppe</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33693,31775,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33693, 31775, 7)</a>.The Ogres ruling the island have enslaved Goblins to work in these mines under the leadership of the fierce <a href=\"#/wiki/Grubokk\">Grubokk</a>. This is because these mines are a great source of <a href=\"#/wiki/Opal\">Opals</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Chip\">Onyx Chips</a>. Unfortunately, the goblins are treated very cruelly and you will find many of their corpses scattered around the mines. You will also be able to find the NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/An%20Imprisoned%20Goblin\">An Imprisoned Goblin</a> here. Sometimes you will find an unannounced raid of <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystalcrusher\">Crystalcrushers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Drillworm\">Drillworms</a> here, so be careful!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Krailos Mines NPCs (2 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/An%20Imprisoned%20Goblin\">An Imprisoned Goblin</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/An%20Imprisoned%20Goblin\"><img alt=\"An Imprisoned Goblin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/An_Imprisoned_Goblin_79f6c9.gif\" width=\"142\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Servant</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Krailos Mines</strong>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Grubokk\">Grubokk</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Grubokk\"><img alt=\"Grubokk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grubokk_8f0f15.gif\" width=\"77\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Foreman</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Krailos Mines</strong>.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["krailos-quest"]}